{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Calibri;}}\fs22  Duplicate Ticket Closure  Agent Response Template\line \line Subject: Duplicate Ticket Closed  Please Refer to Your Original Ticket\line \line Thank you for reaching out to US Capital Private Bank Support. This ticket has been closed as it is a duplicate of a request you have already submitted. To avoid delays and ensure all communication remains clear and organised, we kindly ask that you continue to use your original detailed ticket for this matter.\line \line If you need to provide additional information or clarification, please reply directly within your original ticket rather than creating a new one. This allows our support team to resolve your request more efficiently.\line \line For your convenience, you may track progress and responses anytime by logging into the Support Portal.\line \line Should you have a new or unrelated matter, please feel free to open a separate ticket.\line \line Thank you for your cooperation and understanding.\line \line Sincerely,\line Customer Support Team\line US Capital Private Bank\line \line  Avoiding Duplicate Support Tickets\line \line At US Capital Private Bank, our support portal is designed to ensure your inquiries and service requests are handled efficiently and effectively. To maintain the highest quality of service, we kindly ask all clients not to create duplicate tickets for the same issue or request.\line \line  Why Duplicate Tickets Are Closed\line \line -\line Efficiency in Response: Creating multiple tickets for the same matter can slow down our ability to respond, as it splits resources and creates confusion in tracking.\line \line -\line Accurate Resolution: When all information is contained in a single ticket, our support team can review the full history and context, ensuring a more precise and timely resolution.\line \line -\line Clear Communication: A single ticket keeps all updates, files, and responses in one place, preventing miscommunication or overlooked details.\line \line  What We Did With This Ticket\line \line This ticket has been closed because it duplicates a request you have already submitted. Please refer to your original detailed ticket for updates, responses, and the full handling of your case.\line \line If you need to provide additional details or clarifications, kindly reply directly within your original ticket rather than creating a new one.\line \line  Best Practice for Support Requests\line \line -\line Always reply to the same ticket if your inquiry is related to an ongoing issue.\line \line -\line Use the support portals tracking system to monitor progress.\line \line -\line If you have a separate issue, please open a new ticket to ensure it is tracked and resolved independently.\line \line  Need Assistance?\line \line If you are unsure which ticket to use, our support team is here to help. Please contact us:\line \line -\line Email: customerservice@uscapitalprivatebank.com\line \line -\line Website: https://uscapitalprivatebank.com\line \line -\line Phone Number: +971529926005\line \line  US Capital Private Bank operates under Divine Law Trust structures and Express Trust jurisdiction.\line \line Thank you,\line US Capital Private Bank Client Relations}